WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.489 --> 00:00:07.849
The ancient Egyptians are well known for their
supposed curses, but people have been cursing

00:00:07.849 --> 00:00:12.970
objects, places and even people for as long
as we know.

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:19.340
Most curses are no more than words or even
rumours and usually no consequences ever come

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:20.680
to pass.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:26.840
But here’s some documented cases of real
life curses that actually took their victims

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:32.629
to the grave.

00:00:32.629 --> 00:00:35.470
1.

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:37.920
We start of with a strange one.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:43.420
When you think of curses you probably think
of ancient hidden treasures or black magic.

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:48.570
I imagine you probably don’t think of the
singer Frank Sinatra.

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:54.150
Known as the “My Way” killings, it’s
a phenomenon witnessed in the Philippines.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:01:00.280
Over the past ten years, an unusually high
number of people have been killed whilst singing

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:04.920
Frank Sinatra’s My Way in karaoke bars in
the Philippines.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:12.670
One of the most well known cases was in 2007
when a 29 years old karaoke singer was shot

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.060
dead whilst singing “My Way” on stage.

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:20.430
The shooter’s excuse was that the song was
being sung badly.

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:26.710
In total, over 10 separate killings in Filipino
karaoke bars have been linked to the “My

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:27.710
Way” song.

00:01:27.710 --> 00:01:31.930
And hundreds of other karaoke renditions have
resulted in fights.

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:38.560
As a result many karaoke bars across the country
have since banned the song from being sung.

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:39.560
2.

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:44.069
The Hope diamond is a stunning large blue
diamond that was stolen from the eye of a

00:01:44.069 --> 00:01:48.380
sculpted statue of the goddess Sita in India.

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:53.259
Legends tell of a curse that would befall
the owner of the diamond, the curse foretold

00:01:53.259 --> 00:01:57.060
bad luck and death to all that touched the
diamond.

00:01:57.060 --> 00:02:03.100
For centuries following its theft the Hope
Diamond has supposedly caused misfortune to

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.549
all of its many owners.

00:02:05.549 --> 00:02:12.100
There are numerous documented cases of such
misfortune, but the most infamous include:

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:18.670
An innkeeper who bought the stone from India
to Paris was torn to pieces by wild dogs in

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:20.430
Constantinople.

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:25.130
A son who stole the jewel from his father
and later committed suicide.

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:31.680
A Russian Prince named Ivan Kanitovski who
bought the diamond and was subsequently killed

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.190
by Russian revolutionists.

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:39.670
But whilst he was alive Kanitovski loaned
the diamond to his lover who was then murdered

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:41.760
by Ivan himself.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:48.311
The diamond was acquired by The Smithsonian
Institution in Washington D.C. in 1958 and

00:02:48.311 --> 00:02:50.040
has remained there, undisturbed, ever since.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:51.040
3.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:57.870
The 27 club is a morbid curse that seems to
affect music legends.

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:03.380
Throughout history there have been a remarkably
high number of musicians who died at the age

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:05.210
of 27.

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:11.070
Members of the club include Jim Morrison,
Brian Jones, Jimi Hendrix, Kurt Cobain, Janis

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:18.020
Joplin, Alan Wilson and Amy Winehouse, all
of whom died prematurely at the age of just

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:19.020
27.

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:22.780
Either through alcohol, drugs, murder or suicide.

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:23.780
4.

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:28.820
King Tutankhamun’s curse is possibly the
most famous curse of all time.

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:36.110
In 1922 an excavation backed by Lord Carnarvon
famously discovered the hidden Tomb of Tutankhamun.

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:43.120
But less than six weeks after the discovery
Lord Carnarvon was bitten by a mosquito and

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:45.700
died from infection.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:52.430
In total 8 people who were involved with the
excavation of the tomb died untimely deaths

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:54.090
shortly after.

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:55.090
5.

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:58.420
The Crying Boy was a painting by Bruno Amadio.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:05.070
The painting was mass produced and was very
popular in homes in Britain between the 60s

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:06.370
and 80s.

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:11.710
But it seems that whomever hung the painting
in their home also brought a terrible curse

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:13.240
upon their house.

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:19.099
Because firefighters in the UK reported an
alarmingly high number of houses burning down

00:04:19.099 --> 00:04:21.549
that owned the crying boy painting.

00:04:21.549 --> 00:04:27.409
But the weirdest thing about this mysterious
painting is that when the firefighters examined

00:04:27.409 --> 00:04:33.860
the rubble of the burnt houses, the crying
boy painting remained unburnt, in pristine

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:35.099
condition.

00:04:35.099 --> 00:04:38.880
Despite everything else being burnt to a cinder.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:45.169
In all the cases of houses burning down, the
eerie painting refused to burn.

00:04:45.169 --> 00:04:50.030
This led to national newspapers reporting
that the painting was cursed.

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:51.030
6.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:55.870
The Basano Vase was created as a wedding gift
in the 15th century.

00:04:55.870 --> 00:05:01.830
But the bride was killed on her own wedding
night, leading to rumours that the vase was

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:02.830
cursed.

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:07.849
The vase was then passed down through the
bride’s family over several centuries.

00:05:07.849 --> 00:05:11.460
Reportedly causing death for almost all of
its owners.

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:16.689
Eventually a family member saw the unusual
pattern of deaths associated with the vase

00:05:16.689 --> 00:05:18.900
and locked it away.

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:25.540
The vase wasn’t found again until 1988 with
a note inside that read, “Beware… this

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:32.939
vase brings death.”, but the new owner took
no notice and sold it at an auction, he later

00:05:32.939 --> 00:05:36.949
died, only a few months later.

00:05:36.949 --> 00:05:43.210
The vase went on to cause the deaths of 3
more vase owners over the course of just a

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.210
decade.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:48.469
At which point it was buried for good in an
undisclosed location.

00:05:48.469 --> 00:05:49.469
7.

00:05:49.469 --> 00:05:53.150
But it’s not just objects that have been
cursed.

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:58.050
Curses have been associated with a handful
of hollywood blockbusters, where harm came

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:02.490
to the film crew during and after production.

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:05.039
including The Exorcist and The Poltergeist.

00:06:05.039 --> 00:06:09.960
But the most cursed of them all was The Omen.

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:15.999
Shortly before filming even began, The Omen
star Gregory Peck’s son killed himself.

00:06:15.999 --> 00:06:22.819
Afterwards, on the way to filming, Peck’s
plane was hit by lightning, so was the scriptwriter’s

00:06:22.819 --> 00:06:25.720
plane and the executive producer’s plane.

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:32.360
During shooting, the hotel where the producers
were staying was bombed by the IRA, and so

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:37.349
was a restaurant the directors and actors
were scheduled to eat at.

00:06:37.349 --> 00:06:42.360
Also a tiger handler that helped with the
filming of The Omen was eaten alive by the

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:43.360
tiger.

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:48.520
But it doesn’t end there, after filming
had finished, special effects consultant John

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:53.229
Richardson was involved in a car crash that
killed his assistant.

00:06:53.229 --> 00:07:01.610
And when Richardson scrambled out of the wreckage
he looked up and saw a road sign that read:

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:04.440
“Ommen, 66.6km”.

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:12.219
Even the date of the crash crash was cursed,
it took place on Friday the 13th of August,

00:07:12.219 --> 00:07:13.219
1976.

00:07:13.219 --> 00:07:30.159
There’s definitely something very sinister
about that film.

